Error [E0315]: This pattern binds 2 members, but the tuple has 3
  --> tuple_destructure_arity.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     (x, y) :: (x: 1, y: 2, z: 3)
    |     ^^^^^^
 Why: A tuple pattern must name every member, so none is dropped by accident
 Fix: Name all 3 members, or keep some with `{ x, y, .. } :: …`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0315
